<h5>MEDIA CONTACTS</h5>
<p>Following is a media relations contact list for The Salvation Army in Florida. State media relations are handled by Florida Divisional Headquarters. All local media are asked to first contact their local Salvation Army representative for requests for spokespersons and other inquiries.</p>
